1 0 0 1 62 730 Tm
(5.2 Access must be revoked within twenty-four hours of a person leaving the organization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.3 The results of each access review must be recorded, including the reviewer identity and) Tj
T*
(the date of review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Privileged Access) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.1 Privileged access must be time-limited and granted only for the duration of the) Tj
T*
(approved task.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6.2 All privileged sessions must be logged, and session logs must be retained for twelve) Tj
T*
(months.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Guidance) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Teams should consider adopting hardware security keys where practical. This is a) Tj
T*
(recommendation and is not a mandatory control.) Tj
T*
ET
